      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Helvetia%2C_West_Virginia",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Helvetia Village Historic District earned a spot on the National Register of Historic Places in 1978.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
