      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Helvetia%2C_West_Virginia",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Swiss craftsmen such as masons, carpenters, cobblers, watchmakers, hatters, cheese makers, and musicians arrived across the Atlantic to build the community.",
